# One day as 6 bars — the conductor life scheduler.
#
# Mapping:
#   - bar_duration 4h  →  1 bar = 4 hours
#   - 6 bars           →  1 day = 24 hours
#   - 1 eighth note    →  4h / 8 = 30 minutes  (subdivision resolution)
#
# The third bar below contains a "second sleep" texture: a whole note
# subdivided into eight eighth-notes alternating wake/sleep at 30-minute
# resolution.

bar_duration 4h

| sleep:w |
| sleep:w |
| sleep:w[wake:e,sleep:e,wake:e,sleep:e,wake:e,sleep:e,wake:e,sleep:e] |
| wake:w |
| work:w |
| rest:w |
